        <p class="font-display text-2xl font-800 text-white text-sm">Connect With Edu<span class="accent-text text-sm">Shastra</span>:</p>
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/EduShastra.Philanthropy/" class="accent-link text-sm">ⓕ Facebook</a><br/>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/edushastra/" class="accent-link text-sm"> 📸 Instagram</a><br/>
