      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="font-semibold text-white text-sm">Courses</p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
          <li><a href="https://www.edushastra.com/cat-2026/" class="accent-link">CAT Preparation</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.edushastra.com/gmat-prep/" class="accent-link">GMAT Preparation</a></li>
